OL,5,G0030 Through the Night
OL,6,     FPianist Benjamin Grosvenor joins
OL,7,     Fconductor Shiyeon Sung and the
OL,8,     FAuckland Philharmonia to perform
OL,9,     FMozart's Piano Concerto No 21.
OL,10,G0630 Breakfast
OL,11,     FHannah French presents Radio 3's
OL,12,     FBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,13,     Femail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,14,G0900 Saturday Morning
OL,15,     FTom Service meets composer Eric
OL,16,     FWhitacre to discuss his new album
OL,17,     F'Eternity in an Hour', which
OL,18,     Fcombines his love of choral music,
OL,19,     Felectronica and synthesisers.
OL,20,G1200 Earlier... with Jools Holland
OL,21,     FJools is joined by the historian,
OL,22,     Fauthor and TV presenter Dan Jones.
