OL,5,G1300 Key Changes: Radio 3's...
OL,6,     F...Essential History of Classical
OL,7,     FMusic. 1853, Dusseldorf. A young
OL,8,     FJohannes Brahms visits the home of
OL,9,     FRobert and Clara Schumann.
OL,10,G1400 Record Review
OL,11,     FAndrew McGregor with a thorough
OL,12,     Flook at the week's classical music
OL,13,     Freleases, plus news and
OL,14,     Frecommendations.
OL,15,G1600 Sound of Cinema
OL,16,     FEdith Bowman showcases the very
OL,17,     Fbest in screen music. In this
OL,18,     Fweek's special edition, she'll
OL,19,     Ftake a deeper dive into the
OL,20,     F'songwriters of the silver
OL,21,     Fscreen.'.
